Recommends: python3-nautilus | nemo-python | python3-caja | dolphin
Description: create project folder structures from templates
 FolidStruct creates the folder structure of a new project with one click from the
 file manager's context menu, so every project uses the same folder names.
 .
 Templates define the subfolders; the project folder name can start with the
 date and a progressive number. GNOME Files (Nautilus), Nemo, Caja and Dolphin
 are supported.
